      "Derive accepted as !needs_replan && !needs_work for recognized completion reviews, reconcile missing or contradictory maps, preserve non-review pass-through and all-referenced-control validation.",
      "Renew V2 and run V2b plus strict changed-Swift lint; retain failed V2 as failed and preserve passing T1 evidence.",
      "Complete serial T3–T6, V3–V9 and L-V1–L-V5 with independent test-integrity, adversarial and combined-tree reviews; finalizer records exact reviewed commit and non-force push to Draft PR #109."
    ],
    "nonGoals": [
      "No generic rewriter, silent max-step increase, mock-success repair, second scheduler or parallel database.",
      "No upstream producer-contract or Work Runtime P1 reimplementation, provider-auth repair or release."
