    "constraints": [
      "Use immutable user-scope codex-design-and-implement-review-loop; one native plan item with serial internal T1→T6.",
      "Preserve current dirty T1/T2 source/tests/progress and all tmp evidence; no reset, stash, broad rewrite or T1 reimplementation.",
      "Worker edits only exact plan writePaths and own progress file; shared indexes, README, review-dependent status and archiving belong to serial reconciliation.",
